===============================================================================
SUCCESS CRITERIA
===============================================================================

The standalone utility should:

✓ Run independently from CI/CD.
✓ Require only network access to SonarQube.
✓ Collect quality metrics for configured projects.
✓ Calculate KLOC from NCLOC.
✓ Calculate defect density and related metrics.
✓ Generate JSON, CSV, and HTML reports.
✓ Log every execution.
✓ Be configurable without code changes.
✓ Be reusable for any project by updating the configuration file only.